# Bifrost SLOs

Performance targets for the Bifrost OLAP warehouse. All numbers below are `TBD (pending bench:bifrost)`. They will be replaced with verified figures from the `bench:bifrost` criterion suite once that suite runs against a named, fixed hardware profile.

> **No performance number ships in this doc unless a verified bench run produced it.** The benchmark suite backing these figures is authored in the consolidated bench pass (after Stage 4 + 4b + 5 are green). Do not replace these placeholders with estimates.

